name stretchy
category Package
revision 75140
shortdesc Macros for creating stretchy TeX symbols
longdesc This package helps to create "stretchy" math symbols. It
longdesc provides various ready-made stretchy symbols, as well as
longdesc auxiliary macros for creating them. The package has no
longdesc dependencies and supports both pdfTeX and LuaTeX.
